(c4) A[Lamb of God, who takest away the sins of the world, spare us, O Lord.](e)GNUS(g) De(gh)i,(h.) (,) qui(h) tol(i)lis(hg) pec(h)cá(ji)ta(j) mun(k)di,(i_[oh:h]h_[oh:h]) (:) par(j)ce(i) no[/](h)bis(i) Dó(g)mi(h)ne.(h.) (::) 
A[Lamb of God, who takest away the sins of the world, graciously hear us, O Lord.](e)gnus(g) De(gh)i,(h.) (,) qui(h) tol(i)lis(hg) pec(h)cá(ji)ta(j) mun(k)di,(i_[oh:h]h_[oh:h]) (:) ex(j)áu(i)di(h) nos(i) Dó[/](g)mi(h)ne.(h.) (::) 
A[Lamb of God, who takest away the sins of the world, have mercy on us.](e)gnus(g) De(gh)i,(h.) (,) qui(h) tol(i)lis(hg) pec(h)cá(ji)ta(j) mun(k)di,(i_[oh:h]h_[oh:h]) (:) mi[](j)se(i)ré(h)re(i) no(g.)bis.(h.) (::)
